     1	#!/usr/bin/env python3
     2	"""Guarded Singular standard-basis jobs with typed promotion scope.
     3	
     4	The public entry point is :func:`guided_groebner`.  It emits a standalone
     5	Singular script from a caller-supplied prelude and generator list, runs it under
     6	``stdbuf -oL``, parses machine markers, and returns a typed verdict plus a JSON
     7	serializable certificate.
     8	
     9	The modular-to-characteristic-zero promotion implemented here is intentionally
    10	narrow: a modular dimension-zero result is promoted only when the caller has
    11	declared the ideal homogeneous for positive weights and requested the
    12	properness scope.  Modular unit ideals are not promoted by default.
