+## Corrected S6 replay
+
+Although S6 was not one of the six requested remainder skeletons, correcting
+the source exponent invalidated the charged `ell=2` tally. It was therefore
+necessary to repair it before reporting progress toward N1.
+
+Propositions 6.3/6.4 give
