+box/g9966n1b2-20260903/verify_results.py
+```
+
+Key structured outputs are:
+
+```text
+charged-inputs-check.json       frozen-input custody
+enumeration.json                exact eight-row census and descents
+top-pin-audit.json              S5 recurrence, branches, solved coefficients
+split-unsplit-triage.json       split census and all exact no-split families
+controls/controls-summary.json  tame and perturb controls
+results-summary.json            independent consolidated verifier
+```
+
+Every subprocess was invoked with `stdbuf -oL -eL` and an explicit per-call
+timeout. Singular calls used at most three cores for the modular batches and
+one core for exact-Q; total concurrency never exceeded the five-core ceiling.
+Timeout wrappers and the guided runner terminate their child process groups.
+
+To replay the short, non-CAS audits:
+
+```text
+python3 box/g9966n1b2-20260903/lane_driver.py verify
+python3 box/g9966n1b2-20260903/lane_driver.py enumerate
+python3 box/g9966n1b2-20260903/top_pin_audit.py
+python3 box/g9966n1b2-20260903/split_and_unsplit_triage.py
+python3 box/g9966n1b2-20260903/controls.py
+python3 box/g9966n1b2-20260903/verify_results.py
+```
+
+The final verifier reports:
+
+```text
+S5: DEAD[UNIT_IDEAL_CHAR0]
+S6: DEAD[UNIT_IDEAL_CHAR0]  (corrected replay)
+lane six: 1 dead, 5 open
+non-S8 tally: 2 dead of 7
+banked S8: dead
+N1_closed: false
+overall: PARTIAL
+```
+
+## Final closure statement
+
+The S5 timeout is closed with a source-correct Proposition 6.3/6.4 descent,
+exact terminal-band parametrization, exhaustive algebraic branch cover, three
+prime screens, and exact characteristic-zero unit certificates. The same
+source audit exposed and repaired the earlier S6 exponent error. This yields
+two sound deaths among the seven non-S8 skeletons.
+
+The remaining exact obstruction set is
+
+\[
+\boxed{\{S1,S2,S3,S4,S7\}}.
+\]
+
+Each retains at least one unbuilt strict-below joint chart, and none has a
+complete exact-Q death certificate on its no-split complement. Therefore the
+only valid degree-wide verdict is **PARTIAL**.

