+No support inferred from a lower bound was silently upgraded to an equality.
+The serialized arrays in `split-unsplit-triage.json` list every `(r,s)` pair,
+every partition, and each partition-specific parameter count.
+
+| ID | corrected `(n',m';M2',V2';ell)` | `(delta1,delta2,B)` | `h`; alpha dims; beta dim | partitions | parameters excluding T | generic rows |
+|---|---|---|---|---:|---:|---:|
+| S1 | `(18,12;-4,1;6)` | `(1/3,-1/3,-4/3)` | `13; 15,25,32; 24` | 7 | `110..114` | 352 |
+| S2 | `(36,24;8,1;2)` | `(7/9,-1/9,-4/9)` | `39; 44,68,73; 67` | 56 | `292..302` | 1558 |
