+\sigma=\sum_{j<10}a_j\theta^j+\pi\theta^{10},\qquad
+\gamma=\theta.
+\]
+
+Then the transformed polynomials lie in `k[gamma,pi]`, are monic in `pi`, and
+have degrees
+
+\[
+n'=99/11=9,\qquad m'=66/11=6.
+\]
